WEBVTT

00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:04.150
Dear...

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:04.900
Hmm?

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.190
The girls are coming home today, right?

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:09.370
Yeah.

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:13.110
We should cook extra for guests, huh?

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:14.070
Oh, yes!

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:17.240
And we're going to open the window, too!

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.280
Window?

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.160
That's right.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:22.030
Happiness will come in from the window.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:32.970
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:28.090
Keep on holding me

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:32.980
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:45.800
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:45.800
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:50.990
The precious arms

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:55.990
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:55.990
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:03.300
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:03.300
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:12.800
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:12.800
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:20.050
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:20.050
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:27.950
But if you remain by my side

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:27.950
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:32.260
Keep on holding me

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:35.950
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:35.930
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:43.100
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:43.100
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:48.450
This love...

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:48.450
Omoi wo

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.510
Shine In The Darkness

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:11.650
That's...

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:28.210
That's...

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:32.670
Rynax!

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:34.800
Damn! What the hell is going on?

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:42.050
Dammit! A fine time for my engine to stall!

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.100
So it's an anti-Blue unit?

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:54.570
Why? Why are Rynax...

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.700
Too slow, Black Tights!

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:10.500
Doug!

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:16.460
Kurau!

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.830
Rynax soldiers...

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:25.440
Saito! This is what you've been doing?

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.350
Alpha Seven, keep moving!

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.980
What do you think this test is for?

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:34.900
If they have the power of Rynax, then...

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:36.150
Doug! Can you get it moving?

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:37.150
Working on it now!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.200
It's working. Get on!

00:03:56.930 --> 00:04:01.470
We did not expect them to have
an AR system with them.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:03.970
Understood!

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.760
I'll monitor the situation and
continue collecting data.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:10.890
And one more thing. How shall we deal with Detective Ayaka Steiger?

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:14.100
There are many things I'd like to ask her.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.690
Bring her in alive.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.320
Yes, sir! We will continue the operation.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:25.360
Steiger... It must be in the blood.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.950
Dammit! I'm not getting much speed or altitude!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:29.950
How are we doing? Have we lost them yet?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.330
Is Ayaka following us?

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.400
I'll draw them towards me.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:37.960
Take care of Christmas and Windt.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:38.840
Kurau!

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.340
That's ridiculous! Look how many of them there are!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:45.130
Don't worry. I'll catch up soon.
Just wait for me here, okay?

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.090
But... Kurau, your body...

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.970
Thanks, Christmas.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:52.060
Kurau!

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:56.960
I'll have to buy some time...

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.900
But... these people are not Rynax.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.800
They have footprints of Rynax...

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:03.610
Very strong footprints!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:08.820
All of you! Having such strong powers will destroy your body!

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.080
You'll die!

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:18.220
They're smiling?! So they know what they're doing?

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:38.770
They willingly made the choice to have Rynax powers...

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:55.750
Kurau!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.210
Christmas!

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:09.590
Kurau!

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:22.610
Ayaka!

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:32.030
Ayaka! Ayaka!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.670
Kurau! They're coming!

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:43.090
Christmas, please take care of Ayaka. She's hurt.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.640
Now, come and follow me.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:58.560
Alpha 3 to Alpha 1.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.850
We've recovered one AR system from Ayaka Steiger's car.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:04.230
However, she is not in the car.

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.940
We're currently searching the area.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:08.360
I'll report back if the situation changes.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.170
I'm beat...

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:25.750
Ayaka!

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:45.890
I'm using too much of my power...

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:49.150
If I keep on going like this, then Rynax
will start coming out of me again...

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.870
All right! I found 'em!

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.960
Ayaka, hang in there.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.340
That was the commissioner's squad...

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.390
Ayaka...

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.260
Shoulda killed...

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:17.930
What?

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:24.100
I should have killed the commissioner back then...

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:25.150
If only I...

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.110
Ayaka! it's okay!

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.740
Don't torture yourself any more... Ayaka...

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.490
Windt!

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:41.540
Regel...

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.370
Wait!

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:03.640
Regel...

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:12.940
Kurau, where are you?

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:30.460
Kurau, are you sad?

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:33.800
If I didn't do that, you might have died.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.090
Regel...

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.930
That's why you've gotten so beaten up...

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:47.390
it's because you've been trying to protect
this world, even though you're Rynax.

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:49.650
Regel... You...

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.360
You must be suffering too, right?

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:05.200
Regel... You're warm.

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:12.040
My brother and I are guilty of a crime.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.000
It's not your fault.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.720
The GPO brought you into this world...

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:18.260
That's why...

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:26.020
My brother is calling...

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:31.520
Regel!

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.030
Regel... Wait...

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:41.070
Wait...

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:44.080
Christmas...

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:59.260
Kurau! Kurau!

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:02.970
Hang on, I'm going to help you now.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.020
It's flowing into me...

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.190
So warm...

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:15.940
This is...

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.320
This is...

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:25.870
Christmas...

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.580
Thank goodness!

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:34.290
Kurau, don't be so reckless!
Your body is all beaten up...

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.390
Okay...

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:36.840
I'm sorry, Christmas.

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:39.510
I made you worry a lot.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.470
You're right.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:45.430
You're the one who's been
making my body all better.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:46.600
Kurau...

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:49.340
From now on, we'll be together.

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:52.390
Whatever happens, you and I
will always be together.

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:54.150
Yeah...

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:56.650
We'll be together, Christmas.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:03.070
Regel's different now than he was before.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:06.450
Maybe he'll listen to us now.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.450
We have to find those two.

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:09.240
Yeah.

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.460
Regel... What happened to your body?

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:21.840
Looks like I overused my power.

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:26.550
Brother, Kurau and I were the same.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.680
I bet you're the same too.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.980
What do you mean? Regel...

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.350
You still don't get it?

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:37.060
We're Rynax, but at the same time, we're also human!

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.730
We're... human?

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.650
Don't be ridiculous.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.900
We're just using these human bodies.

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:46.160
We're Rynax!

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:54.580
We've lost our human wills
and have become uncontrollable.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.540
In Commissioner Saito's eyes, we're failures.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.710
Human wills?

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.110
That's right.

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:04.430
That's why they're trying to get rid of us now.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.250
Get rid of us? US?

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:08.470
I won't let them do that!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:32.330
Watch out!

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:47.340
Regel!

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:49.930
Stop, Regel! Run!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.490
Run, Regel!

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:57.480
REGEL!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.440
Brother... Are you sad?

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.320
What are you saying... Regel...

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.340
it's funny, isn't it?

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:09.990
Even though I'm Rynax, I'm just like a human.

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:11.410
You are, too...

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.290
What are you talking about?!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.420
Brother...

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:17.550
Rynax are going to pour out...

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:20.590
Lots and lots of them...

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:39.370
Rynax...

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:40.520
...they're pouring out.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:00.540
Regel...

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:08.300
Why did this happen?

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.010
What's that light?

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:29.860
Windt!

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:34.860
Regel!

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:36.660
REGEL!

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:54.350
You've gotten faster, Regel.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.050
I won't lose next time.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:59.390
What is this?

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:16.200
Ah! The Rynax are...

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.070
Christmas!

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:19.080
Okay!

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:31.380
Rynax...

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:38.430
Did you hear of this world because I was here?

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:42.060
Is that why you wanted to come out into this wide world?

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:44.230
But you mustn't.

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:45.940
You mustn't come out.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.980
I'm sorry. I know you want to.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:53.030
I know you want to come out
into the wide world.

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:56.320
But please... go back...

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:58.410
Go back to the world you came from...

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:00.620
Please.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:18.410
Kurau, I can hear the voices of the Rynax.

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:20.720
Yes, they're crying...

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:25.060
They're crying because they've been told not to come out into the wide world.

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:31.020
I'm sorry.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:35.400
Now... go back, Rynax.

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:36.950
To the world you came from.

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:01.560
Saito...

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.390
Saito!

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:09.190
You killed my younger brother!

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.940
SAITO!

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:19.950
Lonely Freedom

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:14.360
Windt? What is it?

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:16.070
What are you going to do to him?

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:19.280
He's mad... and he's sad... Windt!

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:40.680
Lonely Freedom

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:33.210
SAITO!

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:50.770
Lonely Freedom

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:58.280
Windt is...

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:01.740
I felt it for a brief moment...

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.080
It was a deep sadness...

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.040
We have to go after him.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:09.750
Yes...

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:45.030
What have I done?

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:06.810
They're mourning those who died.

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:16.310
This town is trying to get back on its feet...

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:18.190
Yeah.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.490
We're almost at the hospital.

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:24.780
Hang in there, Ayaka.

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:26.420
Forget the hospital...

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:28.410
We have to hurry or Windt will...

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:31.160
We can't let him do any more horrible things!

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:34.790
Ayaka, we'll go together.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:36.960
After you get treated.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:42.260
Yes, we have to go.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:47.610
Windt lost his Pair and is in a dangerous state.

00:20:47.610 --> 00:20:53.230
If he continues to use his powers,
he may let the Rynax pour out again.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:54.770
And if that happens...

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:01.940
I don't want anyone else to die.

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:05.060
Not Windt... Not the GPO...

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:06.200
Yeah.

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:11.830
I can no longer protect anyone
by running away or hiding...

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.210
Not Christmas...

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:15.750
And not us...

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.910
From a great distance

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:46.910
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:56.080
You smile at me

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:56.080
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:05.560
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:05.560
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:14.640
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:14.640
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:23.880
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:23.880
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:32.990
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:32.990
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:42.130
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:42.130
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.270 --> 00:22:51.240
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.270 --> 00:22:51.240
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.480 --> 00:23:06.230
Moonlight

00:22:53.480 --> 00:23:06.230
Moonlight

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:11.950
Next Episode

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:11.950
Kurau!

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:13.990
Where's the Ryna sapien?

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:16.660
Why am I... Why am I doing this?

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:19.540
Oh, no... they keep pouring out...

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:22.000
it's easy. I've done it before.

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:24.960
The Light At The End
